REMARK   3                                                                            
REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : CRYSTAL STRUCTURES WERE RIGID-BODY FIT INTO            
REMARK   3  STEREOCHEMICAL AND SECONDARY STRUCTURE RESTRAINTS WERE USED TO            
REMARK   3  ENSURE THAT ALPHA-HELICES AND BETA-SHEETS DID NOT DEVIATE FAR             
REMARK   3  FROM THEIR EXPECTED GEOMETRY. MANUAL ADJUSTMENTS WERE KEPT TO A           
REMARK   3  MINIMUM TO REDUCE HUMAN BIAS IN THE MODELING PROCEDURE, WITH              
REMARK   3  COOT ONLY BEING USED TO FIX OBVIOUS ERRORS SUCH AS C-BETA                 
REMARK   3  DEVIATIONS. A FINAL CHECK OF MOLPROBITY AND CROSS CORRELATION             
REMARK   3  WAS DONE TO ENSURE MODEL QUALITY.                                         
